{"summary":"Control Global Flights, Test Your ATC Skills!","description":"\"Mini Airways\" is a minimalist real-time aviation management game. You’ll play as a busy air traffic controller, guiding airplanes for takeoff and landing, directing them to their destinations, and most importantly, avoiding collisions! Show off your superior commanding skills at airports around the world, such as London, Tokyo, Shanghai, Washington, and more. Use unique runway configurations and various tools to manage the airspace as long as possible in the face of increasingly dense flights.\n\n[Game Features]\nMinimalist game interface\nReal-time control of flights taking off and landing\nGlobal real-world airport maps\nClassic historical events recreated\nEmergency handling of unexpected incidents\n\n[Full Content]\n17 classic airports from countries around the world\nOver 10 types of airport upgrades and historical events\n\n[Contact Us]\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@IndieGamePublisherErabit\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/P6vekfhc46\nEmail: support@erabitstudios.com","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/25UZSITl60c?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dfOiVpd-i5_gkn-Aj6T9yUIuu_ofYl-wUxduC0B5jNg_ppG5Y-J1K8ZvLjn88CPMntEIMT5xqwIm31DOnoV7KQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jwNgFLXcHKhoai6q_P6-Mq_YpEtKlDPymynx4uoiFnP1q8rCKf0aOVGb6Zxxelq9hEJCo6wE_DIC-L1rFbu5M-Y","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LeySslYkzdAInyQ2glSO9sfaTx91fFbhbIm6lu1cofKU9azfqEqAYGX5ryEk_5qbHIbuuB_DkNG260cnGNmAjw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rc16BrEyDml6N7Wjg6KFiBtIFLTvj8IlqJEq9lkzymm2Mrb0RJ-EKWtGleXjLfwPC9AwQg9mL17ZGvXuAxDX","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Fd-p_Uqtr5BOnFw0OOj7qIvjVlpOj-DpQNg3g8WpBSMYe6R39LsaClx6RlY6Kk7IeR3hZTQddz_unM5tRIQECA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DiHAehgk_ymxShAhBb7EzspFqzRxsjYd7ayK5P5rMz71SqGeTVKPb9NA--oE-Vm7Bdne8NHiZq6dwNBuhUBUCg","https:/